# /sdd-compat

Purpose:
  Compatibility checker for SDDRA command wrappers across .sdd/, .claude/, .kilo/.

Owns: commands/sdd-compat.sdd

Description:
  Check command registry consistency: ensure each command has all three
  required wrappers and consistent metadata.

Usage:
  /sdd-compat
  /sdd-compat --fix

Options:
  --fix  Attempt to sync missing wrappers

Mode: READ_ONLY

InitialLoad:
  - .sdd/commands/INDEX.sdd

Output:
  Compatibility report with OK/MISSING/DRIFT status per command.

Rules:
  [COMPAT-01] All commands MUST be present in .sdd/commands/, .claude/commands/, .kilo/command/.
  [COMPAT-02] Report must list discrepancies.
  [COMPAT-03] --fix must not overwrite custom content without confirmation.

Navigation:
  CommandsIndex: @INDEX.sdd

State: +
